sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant FU as Field Unit Client (Browser / PWA)
    participant IDB as Client IndexedDB Queue
    participant SVR as Central Node / Server
    participant LEDGER as Blockchain Ledger (MongoDB)

    Note over FU,IDB: Tactical Outage Phase (DDIL Disconnected)
    FU->>FU: User records ammunition issue / consumption
    FU->>FU: Increment device seq: s = s + 1
    FU->>FU: Sign event: HMAC-SHA256(key, eventPayload)
    FU->>IDB: Append signed event to offline queue

    Note over FU,SVR: Connectivity Restored (Auto-Sync Triggered)
    FU->>IDB: Read un-synced events ordered by seq
    FU->>SVR: POST /api/sync/batch { deviceId, events, batchId }

    Note over SVR: Server Verification & Merge
    SVR->>SVR: 1. Verify HMAC signatures against device pre-shared key
    SVR->>SVR: 2. Check duplicate batchId / eventIds (Idempotency)
    SVR->>SVR: 3. Monotonic sequence gap check (seq == expectedSeq)
    
    alt World-State Conflict (e.g. Lot already transferred elsewhere)
        SVR->>LEDGER: Add CONFLICT_DETECTED Block (Audit record, no silent drop)
        SVR-->>FU: Status 200 with conflict report
    else Clean State Validation
        SVR->>LEDGER: Add transaction Block(s) with OFFLINE_SYNC metadata
        SVR->>SVR: Update DeviceState (lastSeq = s, syncedAt = now)
        SVR-->>FU: Status 200 { syncedCount, status: 'PROCESSED' }
    end

    FU->>IDB: Mark events as synced or purge from local queue
